---

<Layout>
  <header class="sticky top-0 z-40 border-b border-ink-900/10 bg-cream-50/90 backdrop-blur-md">
    <div class="container-page flex h-16 items-center justify-between gap-4">
      <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-2.5" aria-label="ScamKill — trang chủ">
        <span class="grid size-9 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-ink-900 text-amber-400">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M12 3 5 6v5c0 4.4 2.9 8.3 7 9.6 4.1-1.3 7-5.2 7-9.6V6l-7-3Z" stroke-linejoin="round" />
            <path d="m8.8 12 2.2 2.2 4.2-4.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
          </svg>
        </span>
        <span class="leading-tight">
          <span class="block font-display text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink-900">ScamKill</span>
          <span class="block text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ink-600">by QuadDraKe</span>
        </span>
      </a>

      <nav class="hidden items-center gap-6 text-sm font-semibold text-ink-700 lg:flex" aria-label="Điều hướng chính">
        {navLinks.map((link) => (
          <a href={link.href} class="transition hover:text-jade-700">{link.label}</a>
        ))}
      </nav>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <details class="relative lg:hidden">
          <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none rounded-lg border border-ink-900/15 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-ink-800">
            Mục lục
          </summary>
          <div class="absolute right-0 z-50 mt-2 w-52 rounded-2xl border border-ink-900/10 bg-white p-2 shadow-xl">
            {navLinks.map((link) => (
              <a href={link.href} class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-ink-700 hover:bg-cream-50">
                {link.label}
              </a>
            ))}
          </div>
        </details>
        <LeadAndAuthModal client:load triggerLabel="Đăng nhập" initialMode="auth" variant="nav" compact />
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main id="main">
    <!-- HERO -->
    <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-ink-950 text-cream-50">
      <div class="dot-grid absolute inset-0" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <div class="container-page relative grid gap-14 py-16 sm:py-24 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.15fr)_minmax(0,0.85fr)] lg:items-center">
        <div class="reveal">
          <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.08] tracking-tight sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
            ScamKill — Lá chắn AI giúp người cao tuổi và gia đình cùng chống lừa đảo qua điện thoại
          </h1>

          <p class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-cream-50/75">
            Lừa đảo không chờ ai bình tĩnh. ScamKill có mặt ở đúng ba khoảnh khắc:
            trước khi bắt máy, lúc vừa đọc tin nhắn, và ngay trước khi bấm chuyển tiền.
          </p>

          <figure class="mt-8 rounded-2xl bg-white/5 px-5 py-4">
            <blockquote>
              <p class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-amber-200 sm:text-2xl">
                “Không ai phải đối mặt với lừa đảo một mình.”
              </p>
            </blockquote>
            <figcaption class="mt-2 text-xs font-semibold text-cream-50/60">Tầm nhìn ScamKill</figcaption>
          </figure>

          <div class="mt-9 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:flex-wrap">
            <a
              href={appUrl}
              class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-amber-400 px-6 py-3.5 text-base font-bold text-ink-950 shadow-lg shadow-amber-400/20 transition hover:bg-amber-300 active:scale-[0.98] focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-amber-300"
            >
              Mở ứng dụng PWA
              <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" class="size-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M4 10h12M11 5l5 5-5 5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
              </svg>
            </a>
            <a
              href="#demo"
              class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-white/25 bg-white/10 px-6 py-3.5 text-base font-bold text-cream-50 transition hover:bg-white/20 active:scale-[0.98] focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-cream-50"
            >
              Chạy demo Bà Lan
            </a>
          </div>

          <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-cream-50/60">
            Bản chạy thử: <code class="font-mono text-cream-50/80">https://scamkill-pwa.9ez.workers.dev</code>
            · máy local: <code class="font-mono text-cream-50/80">http://localhost:8081</code>
          </p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-cream-50/60">Đội QuadDraKe · HITC InnoStar 2026</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Hero visual -->
        <div class="reveal relative mx-auto w-full max-w-md" role="img" aria-label="Minh hoạ luồng bảo vệ của ScamKill">
          <div class="rounded-[2rem] border border-white/15 bg-white/5 p-4 shadow-2xl shadow-ink-950/60">
            <div class="rounded-[1.5rem] bg-ink-900 p-5">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-cream-50/60">
                <span>Cuộc gọi đến · <span class="font-mono">14:31</span></span>
                <span class="rounded-full bg-amber-400/15 px-2 py-0.5 font-semibold text-amber-300">Chưa xác minh</span>
              </div>
              <p class="mt-4 font-mono text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">0918 765 432</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-cream-50/60">Số lạ, không có trong danh bạ</p>

              <div class="mt-5 space-y-2 text-sm">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl bg-white/5 px-3 py-2.5">
                  <span class="grid size-6 place-items-center rounded-full bg-amber-400 text-xs font-bold text-ink-950">1</span>
                  Cảnh báo trước khi bắt máy
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl bg-white/5 px-3 py-2.5">
                  <span class="grid size-6 place-items-center rounded-full bg-amber-400 text-xs font-bold text-ink-950">2</span>
                  Khoảng dừng 60 giây
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl bg-white/5 px-3 py-2.5">
                  <span class="grid size-6 place-items-center rounded-full bg-amber-400 text-xs font-bold text-ink-950">3</span>
                  Hỏi Mã gia đình · gọi lại số đã lưu
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border border-jade-500/30 bg-jade-500/10 px-3 py-2.5">
                  <span class="grid size-6 place-items-center rounded-full bg-jade-500 text-xs font-bold text-ink-950">4</span>
                  Gia đình gọi lại trong 2 phút
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs font-semibold">
                <span class="rounded-full border border-jade-500/30 bg-jade-500/10 px-2.5 py-1 text-mint-100">SMS</span>
                <span class="rounded-full border border-jade-500/30 bg-jade-500/10 px-2.5 py-1 text-mint-100">Zalo</span>
                <span class="rounded-full border border-jade-500/30 bg-jade-500/10 px-2.5 py-1 text-mint-100">Telegram</span>
                <span class="rounded-full border border-white/15 px-2.5 py-1 text-cream-50/60">Chỉ gửi khi đồng ý</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-4 flex items-center justify-between rounded-2xl bg-amber-400 px-4 py-3 text-ink-950">
              <span class="text-sm font-bold">30.000.000 ₫ được giữ lại</span>
              <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">Kịch bản Bà Lan</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Stats strip -->
      <div class="container-page relative pb-16">
        <dl class="rise grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/10 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
          {stats.map((stat) => (
            <div class="bg-ink-950/80 p-5">
              <dt class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-cream-50/60">{stat.source}</dt>
              <dd class="mt-2 font-mono text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-amber-300 sm:text-3xl">{stat.value}</dd>
